  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/something)  \n[Official Indonesian](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Teka-Teki-Cinta/424)\n\nUi-ju goes to work with a feeling of agitation at the attitude of her boyfriend who is not as good as before, and at the company ends up being fired due to frequent friction with a senior colleague who has passed on her work to Ui-ju.   \nThunderbolt in one day, I'm devastated!!!   \nI came to my boyfriend's house to get comfort, but to make matters worse... Oh, my God😕?   \nA bittersweet love story.   \nUnlike the first time, love is not as happy as it was in the beginning, and love changes according to the truth that nothing lasts forever. Is there anything that doesn't change?   \nMy people, my love, my work... Find the only one!",
